# .u-maker/.env  —  Local credentials for u-maker skills.
#
# This file is NEVER committed (added to .gitignore by /u-prepare-foldertree).
# Copy `.env.example` → `.env` and fill in only the keys you actually use.
# Skills load it via `set -a; . .u-maker/.env; set +a` and then prefer
# env values over interactive prompts.
#
# Keys are grouped by integration. Empty / unset = "ask interactively when needed".

# ── Other integrations ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# No skill currently requires a fixed credential key here.
# Skills add their own keys to this template as they start consuming
# `.u-maker/.env` (e.g. Figma PAT, registry tokens, deploy credentials).
